  "description": "JO CRYSTAL\r\nPools: 7\r\nLoose: 250\r\nA healing crystal awaits being pushed out of the northern route. Destroying it unleashes its energy and takes another minute to regenerate.\r\n\r\nThe crystal I wear around my neck contains an essence that gets recharged when I jack it with a thug who also has a crystal. It gives me confidence at mid, home, social situations, etc. Nobody knows it's a JO crystal but me and my thugs. I have seen it glow white while jerking it with a thug thats how I know this is real. You can come over for as long as you want but I need a picture of you preferably wearing a crystal before I waste my time.\r\n\r\nCreated for VSR by blue_banana",
